# Derived from Control/.gitignore. Only the rules that still have a producer in
# THIS repo are kept; assembler/*.sdf, modules/*.sdf, isaac_assets/ and rl/*
# went with the project.

# FR3 description (tools/assets/fetch_fr3_description.py).
# VENDORED ON PURPOSE: the ~12MB of URDF + meshes are tracked so a fresh clone
# can run the real-FR3 3D viewers without network access. They come from
# franka_description (Apache-2.0, Copyright 2023 Franka Robotics GmbH); the
# LICENSE/NOTICE live in franka/. Regenerate/update with the script.
# Do NOT re-add `/franka/` to .gitignore unless the assets move to a release.

# Planning cache (arm_control/planning/stack.py -> $ARM_CONTROL_ROOT/.cache/planning).
.cache/

# MuJoCo model cache + native log.
.mj_cache/
MUJOCO_LOG.TXT

# Local runtime output.
dataflows/out/
Log/

# Vendor DM CAN shared objects (dlopen'd by hardware/dm_backend.py). Untracked
# AND unignored in Control today, which is how it went missing; name it here.
dlls/

rt/build*/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ruff_cache/

# Local virtualenv for running the leader-follower teleop (see docs/leader-follower-deploy.md).
/.venv/
venv/

# Machine-local configs (现场标定后的端口/零位/方向，勿提交；模板见 *.example.yaml / *_sim.yaml).
*.local.yaml
*.local.yaml.*

# Agent scratch: plans, progress and status docs are regenerated per run and
# are not committed. Durable decisions belong in docs/, verified history in
# docs/history/.
.planning/
.superpowers/
